  "keyFeatures": [
    "CFDI 3.2, 3.3, 4.0 creation and parsing (Ingreso, Nómina, Pagos, Traslados, Complementos)",
    "Retenciones 1.0 and 2.0 support",
    "Digital signing with CSD/FIEL certificates",
    "Integration with major PACs: Diverza, Facturama, Finkok, Prodigia, SW Sapien, Comercio Digital",
    "Descarga Masiva (bulk download) via SAT web services",
    "PDF, HTML, and JSON rendering of comprobantes",
    "DIOT (Declaración Informativa de Operaciones con Terceros) generation",
    "Contabilidad Electrónica 1.3 support",
    "Constancia de Situación Fiscal retrieval",
    "PLD (Prevención de Lavado de Dinero) report generation",
    "SAT Portal: RFC validation, LCO queries, Certifica certificate requests",
    "Listado 69B taxpayer status lookup",
    "CLI for converting CFDI XML to PDF/HTML/JSON"
  ],
